title: "dissmodel-ca: Cellular Automata extension for DisSModel"
abstract: >-
  Cellular automata models for the DisSModel framework (vector and raster substrates): Game of Life, fire spread, growth, snow, diffusion, Wolfram rules and other classic examples, ported from the TerraME model collection.
